      "cooked": "<p>This is a thread for miscellaneous observations and inquiries about the art of SOTM.&nbsp; I've been told before that rules questions should not go in a big unsorted thread, but since these aren't about the rules, hopefully not a big deal.</p><p>Today's question - what's going on with Trueshot's legs?&nbsp; They have a burnished-metal tone which doesn't look natural and doesn't match the color of her face.&nbsp; Is she wearing Lycra pants, or some sort of futuristic artificial tan, or maybe an alchemical preparation that toughens her skin into natural armor?</p>",
