      "created_at": "2013-10-04T15:41:49.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"PePe QuiCoSE\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n PePe QuiCoSE:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Is Fanatic's Incap side a reference to the Spawn comic?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I think it's a homage to X-Men Mutant Massacre.&nbsp; Angel was pinned to the wall by Harpoon, later on his wings were amputated.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/1/1bc1d2373d1ca1f6c8af1d4d64064fcc0aa635dc.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/1bc1d2373d1ca1f6c8af1d4d64064fcc0aa635dc\" title=\"\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/1/1bc1d2373d1ca1f6c8af1d4d64064fcc0aa635dc.jpeg\" alt=\"\" data-base62-sha1=\"3Xy9oNta2tNxDWKPWtxeISLY9mk\" role=\"presentation\" width=\"400\" height=\"237\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\"></span><span class=\"informations\">400×237 114 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
