      "created_at": "2013-10-16T20:44:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>For sad it'd be hard to top Young Legacy...dad holding his daughter's limp body in his arms.&nbsp; At least with Golem Unity, she could eventually get out.&nbsp; We all know what happened with Paulina though....even if she got better (something that may not even be possible - unlike in established comic verses, Seninels has no history of resurrections), it probably wouldn't fix Paul, not after he'd already gone over the edge.</p>",
